{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:77ce84980f55011b55138f60ffa8fb7a", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 5, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: The bug is obvious: the inner loop lets `i == j`, so it can pair an element with itself. Fix:", "turn_key": "sha256:f5d4fa5c1262a9804f0a4f63fe3dd818"}
